## 4. Physical Topology

The initial internal topology consists of a Cisco ISR 2911 connected to a Cisco Catalyst access switch through an 802.1Q trunk.

`STORE-PC1` connects to an access interface assigned to the user VLAN.

```text
                         RTR-01
                     Cisco ISR 2911
                           |
                           | Gi0/1
                           |
                    802.1Q Trunk
                 VLANs 10,20,30,99
                           |
                           | Gi1/0/1
                         SW-01
                    Cisco Catalyst
                           |
                           | Gi1/0/10
                           | Access VLAN 10
                           |
                       STORE-PC1
                     Test Endpoint
```

WAN connectivity is intentionally excluded from this phase. `RTR-01 Gi0/0` remains reserved for the WAN integration performed during Phase 2.

